{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UTT5phi87PcrrDmSA4K46D","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"QLC+ lighting software github repository\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - abossard/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a ...\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/abossard/qlcplus\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - K1ls0/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a free ...\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/K1ls0/qlcplus\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - marc-tissler/qlcplusplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) ...\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/marc-tissler/qlcplusplus\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - binary1230/qlcplus-docker: Docker build for QLC Plus ...\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/binary1230/qlcplus-docker\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - mcallegari/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is ...\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mcallegari/qlcplus\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - Raeschen/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a ...\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Raeschen/qlcplus\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - edogawa23/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a ...\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/edogawa23/qlcplus\"},{\"title\":\"Build software better, together\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/topics/lighting?o=desc&s=updated&utf8=%E2%9C%93\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - r2for/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a free ...\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/r2for/qlcplus\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - s-light/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a free ...\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/s-light/qlcplus\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the QLC+ lighting software GitHub repository:\n\n## Official Repository\n\nThe official QLC+ repository is at **mcallegari/qlcplus** on GitHub. QLC+ is powerful and user-friendly software to control lighting that supports a huge amount of hardware and runs on Linux, Windows (10+), macOS (10.12+), and Raspberry Pi.\n\nQLC+ is open-source lighting control for DMX, Art-Net, sACN and more, designed for live shows, theatre, architectural installations, and venues.\n\nThe official repository URL is: **https://github.com/mcallegari/qlcplus**\n\n## Additional Forks\n\nThe search also revealed several community forks of the project, including versions by abossard, K1ls0, marc-tissler, and others. There's also a Docker build available at binary1230/qlcplus-docker that runs QLC+ in a headless container mode.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a9bc8d3-de76-4362-81a4-f05929423ccc","uuid":"37bf0d0b-adbf-47a0-aba5-4adecdffce52","timestamp":"2026-09-29T18:40:47.276Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"QLC+ lighting software github repository","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_0145JUcem2WRBARwopUg5x5X","content":[{"title":"GitHub - abossard/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a ...","url":"https://github.com/abossard/qlcplus"},{"title":"GitHub - K1ls0/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a free ...","url":"https://github.com/K1ls0/qlcplus"},{"title":"GitHub - marc-tissler/qlcplusplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) ...","url":"https://github.com/marc-tissler/qlcplusplus"},{"title":"GitHub - binary1230/qlcplus-docker: Docker build for QLC Plus ...","url":"https://github.com/binary1230/qlcplus-docker"},{"title":"GitHub - mcallegari/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is ...","url":"https://github.com/mcallegari/qlcplus"},{"title":"GitHub - Raeschen/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a ...","url":"https://github.com/Raeschen/qlcplus"},{"title":"GitHub - edogawa23/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a ...","url":"https://github.com/edogawa23/qlcplus"},{"title":"Build software better, together","url":"https://github.com/topics/lighting?o=desc&s=updated&utf8=%E2%9C%93"},{"title":"GitHub - r2for/qlcplus: Q Light Controller Plus (QLC+) is a free ...","url":"https://github.com/r2for/qlcplus"},{"title":"GitHub - s-light/qlcplus: Q Light C